---
const fields=[['title','Título',160],['category','Categoría',80],['description','Descripción',3000],['transcript','Transcripción',20000],['question','Pregunta',300]] as const;
---
<section data-editor hidden aria-labelledby="story-editor-heading"><h2 id="story-editor-heading">Editar historia</h2><p data-editor-state role="status"></p>
<form data-story-form novalidate>
<p>Completa el contenido, agrega la portada mediante una URL HTTPS y usa un episodio de Spotify para el audio.</p>
{fields.map(([name,label,max])=><div class="story-field"><label for={'story-'+name}>{label}</label>{['description','transcript'].includes(name)?<textarea id={'story-'+name} name={name} rows={name==='transcript'?6:3} aria-describedby={'story-error-'+name}></textarea>:<input id={'story-'+name} name={name} type="text" aria-describedby={'story-error-'+name}/>}<small>Máximo {max} caracteres.</small><span class="story-error" id={'story-error-'+name} data-story-error={name}></span></div>)}
<fieldset data-firestore-fields><legend>Portada y audio</legend><p>Firestore conservará el contenido de la historia, la URL de la portada y el episodio embebido de Spotify.</p>
<label for="story-person-name">Nombre de la protagonista</label><input id="story-person-name" name="personName" type="text" maxlength="100"/>
<label for="story-image-url">URL HTTPS de la imagen</label><input id="story-image-url" name="imageUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://…"/>
<label for="story-firestore-image-alt">Texto alternativo</label><input id="story-firestore-image-alt" name="firestoreImageAlt" type="text" maxlength="500"/>
<div class="story-inline"><label for="story-image-width">Ancho<input id="story-image-width" name="imageWidth" type="number" min="1" max="5000"/></label><label for="story-image-height">Alto<input id="story-image-height" name="imageHeight" type="number" min="1" max="5000"/></label></div>
<label for="story-spotify-url">Enlace del episodio de Spotify</label><input id="story-spotify-url" name="spotifyUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://open.spotify.com/episode/…"/>
<div class="story-inline"><label for="story-duration-seconds">Duración en segundos<input id="story-duration-seconds" name="durationSeconds" type="number" min="1" max="7200"/></label><label for="story-order">Orden<input id="story-order" name="storyOrder" type="number" min="0" max="999" value="0"/></label></div>
</fieldset>
{[0,1,2].map(i=><fieldset><legend>Opción {i+1}</legend><label for={'story-option-'+i}>Texto de opción</label><input id={'story-option-'+i} name={'option-'+i} type="text" aria-describedby={'error-option-'+i}/><span id={'error-option-'+i} data-story-error={'options.'+i+'.label'} class="story-error"></span><label for={'story-explanation-'+i}>Explicación del riesgo y prevención</label><textarea id={'story-explanation-'+i} name={'explanation-'+i} rows="3" aria-describedby={'error-explanation-'+i}></textarea><span id={'error-explanation-'+i} data-story-error={'options.'+i+'.explanation'} class="story-error"></span></fieldset>)}
<p data-story-error="options" class="story-error"></p><p data-story-error="form" class="story-error"></p>
<div class="story-actions"><button type="submit" data-save-firestore>Guardar historia</button><button type="button" data-close-editor>Cerrar editor</button></div>
</form></section>
